Valid wildcardes are:

    ?    - Matches any single character.

  Example: A?B       Matches any three letter combination begining with A
                     and ending with B.

    #<p> - Matches zero or more occurrences of <p>.

  Example: A#BC      Matches any string beginning with A, ending with C,
                     and having any number of B's in between such as AC, 
                     ABC, ABBC etc.

    *    - Matches any multiple character.

  Example: AB*       Matches any string beginning with AB.


